plan Pending
title   Pending Plan amendments, merged once proven
status  proposed
goal
    Plan changes found while building wait here, unmerged, until building proves them right. Each
    decision names the Plan record it changes, the change, why, and the evidence that would prove
    it. One is merged into its Plan only once that evidence holds and the user says yes, then
    removed from here with the merge commit noted on the Epic.
decisions
    D1  @plan.Operations.O3: a cancel during a send leaves the call Held
        Change O3's phrase that says a cancel settles a call on the wire, to match @spec.WriteLanes.R14
        as revised: the call follows its own ending and stays Held. **Why:** the phrase came from the
        old design's `HeldThisTurn`, which is about the `cancel` concurrency policy (the R4 entry in
        code:workflow/specs/spec-log.md). **Proven by:** P4's production lane passing the suite's
        cancel-on-wire cases (PAY-12, PAY-15, LANE-04). Found in @task.V3.T7.
